('DBH 专业板面（动物园派对/无限/守护/签名款等多图案系列）', '板面', 'DBH', NULL, '¥240-270', '初学可/进阶', '{"record_id": "DECK-011", "spec": {"available_sizes": [{"width_in": null, "length_in": null, "wheelbase_in": null}], "construction": null}, "suitability_tags": ["街式", "滑板场", "初学"], "spec_source_url": "https://www.dobyheart.com/product.html", "spec_collected_date": "2026-10-09"}', '国产头部品牌（深圳，2010年创立，2019-2023淘系滑板类目销售额第一）专业板面，图案系列丰富。宽度字段为null：官方商城未标注各图案尺寸；京东自营整板标题显示存在8.0英寸规格（见SET-002）。品牌事实来自官网：成立于2010年、总部深圳、线下600+经销伙伴', 'https://www.dobyheart.com/product.html', '1'),
('Independent Stage 11 Polished Standard', '桥', 'Independent', NULL, '¥430', '初学可/进阶/专业', '{"record_id": "TRUCK-001", "spec": {"size_variants": [{"size_code": "129", "axle_in": 7.6, "height": "55mm", "deck_range_in": [7.4, 7.8]}, {"size_code": "139", "axle_in": 8.0, "height": "55mm", "deck_range_in": [7.8, 8.2]}, {"size_code": "144", "axle_in": 8.25, "height": "55mm", "deck_range_in": [8.2, 8.375]}, {"size_code": "149", "axle_in": 8.5, "height": "55mm", "deck_range_in": [8.375, 8.6]}, {"size_code": "159", "axle_in": 8.75, "height": "55mm", "deck_range_in": [8.6, 9.0]}, {"size_code": "169", "axle_in": 9.125, "height": "55mm", "deck_range_in": [9.0, 9.5]}], "construction": "A356 T6热处理铸铝hanger，铬钼钢轴，Grade 8碳钢kingpin，90a PU垫"}, "suitability_tags": ["街式", "滑板场", "综合"], "spec_source_url": "https://independenttrucks.com/trucks", "spec_collected_date": "2026-10-09"}', '经典55mm标准高街式桥，尺寸覆盖全，终身质保。官方尺寸表已二次核验：139→8.0"轴/7.8-8.2"板面，144→8.25"/8.2-8.375"，149→8.5"/8.375-8.6"；Stage 11高度55mm（锻造空心/钛款53.5mm，Mid系列52mm）；官方另列146/151/166/215等尺寸；159/169配6孔新旧两用底座', 'https://item.jd.com/10095337527533.html', '1'),
('Thunder Lights', '桥', 'Thunder', NULL, '¥385', '初学可/进阶/专业', '{"record_id": "TRUCK-002", "spec": {"size_variants": [{"size_code": "143", "axle_in": 7.125, "height": "Team底座50mm", "deck_range_in": [null, 7.4]}, {"size_code": "145", "axle_in": 7.62, "height": "Team底座50mm/锻造底座49mm", "deck_range_in": [7.4, 7.9]}, {"size_code": "147", "axle_in": 8.0, "height": "Team底座50mm/锻造底座49mm", "deck_range_in": [7.9, 8.12]}, {"size_code": "148", "axle_in": 8.25, "height": "Team底座52mm/锻造底座51mm", "deck_range_in": [8.12, 8.38]}, {"size_code": "149", "axle_in": 8.5, "height": "Team底座52mm/锻造底座51mm", "deck_range_in": [8.38, 8.62]}, {"size_code": "151", "axle_in": 8.75, "height": "Team底座52mm/锻造底座51mm", "deck_range_in": [8.62, 8.85]}, {"size_code": "161", "axle_in": 9.125, "height": "Team底座53mm/锻造底座52mm", "deck_range_in": [8.9, 9.5]}], "construction": "轻量化设计（官方样式图为中空轴结构），尺寸表适用Team/Hollow/Titanium Lights各线"}, "suitability_tags": ["街式", "滑板场", "综合"], "spec_source_url": "https://www.thundertrucks.com/sizing/", "spec_collected_date": "2026-10-09"}', 'DLX旗下轻量化桥，147对应8.0英寸轴、适配7.9-8.12英寸板面。官网不直销无USD价。已二次核验：143→7.125"轴/≤7.4"板，145→7.62"/7.4-7.9"，161→9.125"/8.9-9.5"，与调研数据一致；另存在181（10.0"轴/9.5"+）档位；147/148/149/151数据取自同一官方图表解析，命名即毫米轴距。国内行货价未能在可访问渠道核实 国内行货渠道已核实：Thunder 147（实心/锻造中空）补贴后¥385，与京东 Venture 锻造款价格互证合理。', 'https://item.taobao.com/item.htm?id=757207011202', '1'),
('Venture 标准抛光系列（Hi/Lo）', '桥', 'Venture', NULL, '¥385', '初学可/进阶', '{"record_id": "TRUCK-003", "spec": {"size_variants": [{"size_code": "5.0", "axle_in": 7.62, "height": "Hi和Lo两版（mm未公布）", "deck_range_in": [null, 7.9]}, {"size_code": "5.2", "axle_in": 8.0, "height": "Hi和Lo两版（mm未公布）", "deck_range_in": [7.9, 8.1]}, {"size_code": "5.6", "axle_in": 8.25, "height": "Hi和Lo两版（mm未公布）", "deck_range_in": [8.1, 8.3]}, {"size_code": "5.8", "axle_in": 8.5, "height": "Hi和Lo两版（mm未公布）", "deck_range_in": [8.4, 8.6]}, {"size_code": "6.1", "axle_in": 8.75, "height": "Hi和Lo两版（mm未公布）", "deck_range_in": [8.62, null]}], "construction": "铸铝hanger+钢轴（Deluxe Distribution旗下）"}, "suitability_tags": ["街式", "滑板场", "综合"], "spec_source_url": "https://www.venturetrucks.net/sizes/", "spec_collected_date": "2026-10-09"}', 'DLX旗下经典桥，小数命名即轴宽英寸数，官方提供Hi/Lo两种高度。venturetrucks.com当日宕机，改用DLX官网指向的venturetrucks.net；官方Sizes图8.3-8.4英寸区间未分配（5.6止于8.3、5.8起于8.4）；hanger宽度与Hi/Lo毫米高度官方未公布 国内价已复核：Weyoung授权店 Venture 5.0H/5.2H 实心 ¥385；与京东锻造签名款¥538（DBH店）互证合理。', 'https://item.taobao.com/item.htm?id=836505351414', '1'),
